;; floor at column 5 under the moon window. Pushing into the same panel flips the player out
;; into 6-2 itself, dropping in from above, ninja style, onto the open street (42) just past the pipes
;; the bonus room's own pipe leads to (0.4.43, owner: no longer rising out of a pipe he never went
;; down; never onto a Piranha Plant's pipe, holding right or left as he falls), so the bonus room is
;; entered again only down the pipe at 19 (its coins are not restocked by going round). The clock
;; runs on throughout.
;; Theme and music `dojo`: wooden beams and floor, a shoji band (the `wall` rows, with
;; `ninja:shoji` screens in front), paper lanterns and the round moon window (`ninja` sheet).

